& [Situation]
  + admitted packages already provide signed semantic units relations labels source anchors quotes exact indexes and immutable package ownership
  + deterministic query already performs exact identity exact label context filtering typed traversal optional lexical containment proof assembly and boundary accounting
  + self-hosted ingestion has demonstrated a real bounded corpus rather than only handwritten query fixtures
  + Slice8A and Slice8B now prove compact structural checkpoint discovery and staged custody inspection but those handles describe procedure state rather than semantic relevance
  + the 2026-08-04 Weaver-Planner assessment already specifies identity operation applicability objective candidate-instance and candidate-plan concepts but never became canonical implementation authority
  + the missing waist is an exact generation-bound catalogue projection and typed association trace that turns terms plus purpose into inspectable semantic-address candidates

& [Justification]
  + a catalogue makes the SOP fabric inspectable as table-of-contents and index views without duplicating its authority
  + typed association channels permit fast candidate discovery while preserving why each candidate appeared
  + stable semantic addresses let a later attention host unfold only pertinent SOP material rather than loading the corpus wholesale
  + exact source and package bindings allow every candidate to resolve to records relationships quotes and proof
  + separating proposal ranking from admission makes a future neural router replaceable and safe to test in shadow mode

& [Solution]
  + compile one immutable SemanticAnchorCatalogue from one already admitted semantic-fabric generation
  + derive IdentityAnchorEntry and OperationAnchorEntry projections from existing authoritative units relations packages and source anchors
  + index normalized labels aliases operation phrases kinds purposes contexts and typed relation adjacency without adding semantic claims
  + accept one bounded AnchorQuery naming terms subject purpose use cases boundaries detail needs allowed association channels and budgets
  + emit typed AssociationContribution values and ranked AnchorCandidate values whose exact SemanticAddress values can be resolved by the existing query engine
  + deterministically gate and project candidates into an AnchorQueryResult with boundary account omissions proof and result digest
  + leave learned routing absent from P0 and introduce it later only as another proposal channel bound to exact catalogue and fabric roots

& [Delineation]
  + authoritative_store is admitted signed SOP packages semantic units relations source anchors quotes and recognition state
  + derived_catalogue is a reproducible generation-bound projection that can be discarded and rebuilt
  + association is evidence for inspection priority rather than truth authority permission applicability or effect
  + semantic address identifies an existing exact record and never fabricates digest bytes from resemblance
  + human file line is display navigation while package unit clause span and content digests carry stable machine identity
  + procedure checkpoint handles resume an execution workflow while semantic addresses locate meaning; a bridge may carry one to the other but must not conflate them
  + self-feeding means bounded result-guided retrieval across explicit host passes and not autonomous source admission or authority growth

& [TypedScoreDelineation]
  + [exact_identity] is a binary exact-address match
  + [exact_label] is a binary compiled label or alias match with visible ambiguity
  + [declared_applicability] is an admitted operation-role-to-identity assertion with its own status and evidence
  + [typed_relation_distance] is a bounded path property qualified by relation family direction guards and context
  + [lexical_relevance] is deterministic textual candidate evidence
  + [embedding_similarity] is approximate geometric candidate evidence
  + [learned_route_score] is model-specific proposal evidence bound to router and catalogue digests
  + [evidence_confidence] qualifies a proposition and is not relevance
  + [risk] and [cost] constrain selection and are not negative relevance
  + [authority] is a deterministic admission fact and never a score
  = must: retain channel identity raw basis normalization method evidence and exclusions
  - never: combine heterogeneous quantities into an unexplained scalar whose rank can erase a boundary

& [CandidateMachineForms]
  + [CatalogueIdentity] binds profile catalogue root fabric root admitted package-root set compiler identity and derivation proof
  + [SemanticAddress] binds unit identity content digest package identity package digest kind context identity version and source-anchor references
  + [IdentityAnchorEntry] binds address preferred expression aliases meaning purpose context boundaries relation references lifecycle and authority scope
  + [OperationAnchorEntry] binds address operation class phrases role signature input output preconditions invariants postconditions faults authority requirements effect class and applicability references
  + [ApplicabilityBinding] binds operation role exact identity or kind context purpose conditions boundaries evidence transfer law non-transfer set and closed status
  + [AnchorQuery] binds terms subject purpose use cases include exclude known identities detail needs relation policy association policy authority context and budgets
  + [AssociationContribution] binds channel candidate address basis path evidence channel-local value model identity when applicable and exclusion state
  + [AnchorCandidate] binds address contributions deterministic priority eligibility unresolved guards exact-resolution requirement and compact projection budget
  + [AnchorQueryResult] binds admitted candidates excluded ambiguous contradicted unknown stale unauthorized and clipped sets paths source anchors omissions proof continuation and digest

& [DeterministicPriorityLattice]
  + exact semantic identity precedes exact compiled label
  + declared applicable bindings follow only when their conditions and context are admitted
  + typed relation paths follow under allowed relation families and depth
  + lexical candidates may extend recall when explicitly requested
  + approximate or learned candidates may extend recall only after their own coverage and compatibility checks
  + candidates inside one tier sort by declared channel-local value then stable semantic identity
  + a lower tier cannot outrank an admitted higher tier by score magnitude alone
  + ambiguity at the winning admissible tier remains visible rather than resolved by incidental ordering

& [ProcessingSequence]
  * validate request profile authority context and budgets
  * select the exact admitted fabric generation and matching catalogue root
  * normalize query terms without erasing original spelling or declared identities
  * gather exact identity and exact-label contributions
  * apply subject purpose use-case include exclude status and authority gates
  * exact-join admitted ApplicabilityBinding records
  * expand allowed typed relations within depth node path byte and time budgets
  * optionally add lexical contributions
  * later optionally add compatible approximate or learned contributions as proposals
  * apply the priority lattice preserve ambiguity and resolve every retained address through exact admitted records
  * project the smallest requested details source anchors relationships omissions boundary account and proof
  * digest the normalized result and expose a bounded continuation when eligible results remain

& [SevenFoldExplosion]
  + [fold_1_identity] the subject is generation-bound semantic addressing for purpose-scoped SOP retrieval
  + [fold_2_boundary] derived proposals and projections are inside while new meaning authority effects and hidden-state control are outside
  + [fold_3_data] catalogue address identity operation applicability query contribution candidate result proof and continuation are distinct records
  + [fold_4_relation] names purposes contexts typed relations operation roles source anchors and authority bind without endpoint collapse
  + [fold_5_behavior] compile query propose gate exact-resolve project prove and later learn form the complete flow
  + [fold_6_fault] stale roots ambiguous names context collapse score laundering unsupported applicability hash fabrication budget escape and authority transfer fail closed
  + [fold_7_evidence] fixture derivation deterministic repeatability mutations baseline measurements and exact existing-query equivalence precede adoption

& [FacultyApplication]
  + Observer binds subject purpose consequence and final candidate disposition
  + Honesty checks identity meaning provenance ambiguity status counterevidence and score-channel representation
  + Security checks exact generation authority scope boundaries constraints protected identities budgets and effect separation
  + Weaver forms role-compatible identity-operation seams while retaining differences and non-transfer laws
  + Planner orders expansion and later procedure paths under prerequisites stop conditions and cumulative accounts
  + Refiner returns the smallest sufficient projection without dropping qualifications
  + Scribe preserves the query contributions exclusions paths proof result digest and later correction evidence

& [ImplementationGraduation]
  + [slice_0] canonical formation feature-requirement support and fixture design only
  + [slice_1] pure closed machine forms canonical digest and structural validators over existing fixture identities
  + [slice_2] deterministic catalogue derivation from an already admitted SemanticFabric with exact rebuild equality
  + [slice_3] exact identity label context applicability and typed-relation scan with no lexical or learned channel
  + [slice_4] lexical channel boundary result proof and compact projection with direct-query equivalence where requests overlap
  + [slice_5] self-hosted corpus measurement mutation corpus and operator-readable table-of-contents and operation-index artifacts
  + [slice_6] bridge selected semantic addresses to existing query and attention-procedure requests without provider execution
  + [slice_7] only after a reviewed corpus and metrics create a shadow learned router whose output cannot bypass exact resolution or gates

& [AcceptanceBoundary]
  + identical admitted generation produces byte-identical catalogue and root
  + any package unit relation source anchor or catalogue change alters the appropriate digest or refuses stale use
  + every entry and result resolves to one exact admitted package unit and available source proof
  + ambiguous labels remain multiple candidates and unknown terms remain explicit
  + context boundary authority and lifecycle exclusions are visible
  + channel contribution order and result digests are deterministic
  + score scale mutations cannot cross the priority lattice or create authority
  + no result embeds unrequested full source package or procedure checkpoint bodies
  + all caps enforce bounded output and expose clipping

& [Decision]
  + form a canonical P0 specification and dependency-ordered feature support from this review
  + grant no implementation neural training provider persistence effect remote FPGA or Minecraft authority in this review
  + first future activation should cover only Slice1 closed machine forms and fixture validators
